   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener>
               <salute><hi rend="underline">To Whom It May Concern.</hi></salute>
            </opener>
            <p>I have known <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__5092" type="person">Dr. Anita Orienter</rs>
               for more than 20 years and do consider her as an extraordinary gifted
                  <unclear>and</unclear> intelligent personality. She graduated summa cum laude, has
               written an excellent thesis on <q>The <unclear>Evolution</unclear> of Medieval
                  Renaissance Art</q>. Her career <unclear>confirmed</unclear> her promising
               studies. She taught History of Art at several colleges in <rs
                  ref="#tillich_place_id__1540" type="place">Brazil</rs> and <rs
                  ref="#tillich_place_id__219" type="place">Italy</rs>, later on she specialized in
               restauration. She has ample experience in both teaching and painting. Her pleasant
               personality <unclear>–</unclear> she has a special talent to deal with children – and
               her great artistic talent will enable her to collaborate wit American institutions of
               higher learning.</p>
            <p>Some weeks ago she has completed a portrait of myself which shows her great artistic
               talent and which has been received with enthusiasm by all my friends. I have seen
               many of her paintings which impressed me very much.</p>
            <closer>
               
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person"
                  >Prof. Paul Tillich</rs></signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
